{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white", "label": "ADR 0005: Prepare every image as an RGB JPEG flattened onto white", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "adr_id": "0005", "status": "Accepted", "date": "2026-08-19"}, {"id": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_pillow", "label": "Pillow (PIL)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_rgb_jpeg_over_white_pipeline", "label": "Image preparation: RGB JPEG flattened onto white", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One pure function produces upload bytes: convert to RGB with alpha flattened onto white (not black: web images with transparency sit on light backgrounds and black halos mislead the model), LANCZOS thumbnail to max_size (never upscale), JPEG quality 90, base64. Happens before any socket so an unusable image fails in a millisecond. Bounds upload size and latency; models resize internally anyway."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_exif_orientation", "label": "EXIF orientation honoured before conversion", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Phone photos are stored in sensor order with rotation in a tag, so portraits were described sideways. Applied only when orientation != 1; output carries no EXIF."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_wide_mode_rescale", "label": "Wide-mode (I, I;16*, F) rescale against own min/max", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Image.convert('RGB') clips 16-bit data to white, so samples are rescaled against the image's own extrema before the 8-bit conversion. I;16B/I;16L go through convert('I') first because getextrema()/point() reject them; I;16N has its bytes reinterpreted as the sys.byteorder mode because Pillow routes it through an 8-bit unpacker and clamps to 255. Do not simplify to a convert."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_colour_key_transparency", "label": "Colour-key transparency handling", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PNG colour keys arrive on RGB and L images too and were painted as the keyed colour instead of white, so any info['transparency'] is flattened onto white. A key on a wide-mode image is ignored (the key names a raw sample value and the rescale moves every sample). A key Pillow cannot apply is dropped from a copy so the caller's image keeps it."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_non_finite_samples", "label": "Non-finite samples in F images", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Normalisation is skipped in favour of Pillow's clamping conversion only when an extremum is inf. nan is rescanned because Pillow seeds its extrema scan with pixel (0,0); an all-nan image comes out black."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_never_mutate_callers_image", "label": "Never mutate the caller's image object", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Callers who reuse an image (thumbnailing, saving) would silently get the converted, downscaled copy. Covered by enumerated test cases rather than property tests."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_19_describe_it_design", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white", "target": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_rgb_jpeg_over_white_pipeline", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white", "target": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_exif_orientation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white", "target": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_wide_mode_rescale", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white", "target": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_colour_key_transparency", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white", "target": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_non_finite_samples", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white", "target": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_never_mutate_callers_image", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_rgb_jpeg_over_white_pipeline", "target": "src_describe_it_image_prepare_image", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_rgb_jpeg_over_white_pipeline", "target": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_pillow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white_rgb_jpeg_over_white_pipeline", "target": "src_describe_it_exceptions_imageerror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0005-prepare-images-as-rgb-jpeg-over-white.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0005_prepare_images_as_rgb_jpeg_over_white